6 CONCLUSIONS
In the current paper, a design methodology has been introduced to automate the component selection, configuration layout and geometric sizing of a smallscale quadrotor UAV/MAV, and has been implemented with success. The design optimization methodology allows the designer to use a standard personal computer to solve the complex design problem, and produce a satisfactory preliminary configuration much faster than the usual trial-and-error approach.
